1. **Do not touch, weaken, or restructure the backend orchestration logic** in
   `backend/agent_graph.py`, `backend/app.py`, `backend/state.py`,
   `backend/document_extractor.py`, or the Supabase Edge Functions
   (`supabase/functions/extract-document`, `supabase/functions/orchestrate-agent-run`,
   `supabase/functions/seed-demo-data`) **except** where a task below explicitly asks you
   to extend them (e.g. adding the Tracker Agent node). These already implement real Groq
